:: MP NPC Sera More2 Hub [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "town">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<if !$mpNpcs>><<set $mpNpcs to {}>><</if>>
<<if !$mpNpcs.sera>><<set $mpNpcs.sera to { love: 0, trust: 0, lust: 0, dom: 0, corruption: 0, stage: 0, hasMet: 1, cadence: 25, axis: 25 }>><</if>>
<<set _sera to $mpNpcs.sera>>
<<if _sera.axis is undefined>><<set _sera.axis to (_sera.cadence or 25)>><</if>>
<<if !$daily>><<set $daily to {}>><</if>>
高街钟表铺的玻璃橱窗擦得一尘不染，<<if _sera.hasMet>>塞拉<<else>>修表师<</if>>先低头对了一眼腕表，才翻开柜台上的黄铜校时簿。她说这几天的零碎活计按钟点分成了三栏：上午的煮蛋沙漏、学园挂钟与铜雾钟归在前台急件，下午的行会检定与打烊静坐归在午后内务，城西车站、北坡水塔与新年跨年钟声则另记在出诊专页。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回前页 (0:02)|MP NPC Sera More Hub]]>><<pass 2>><</link>><br>
<<mprepairicon>><<link [[看前台修钟件 (0:03)|MP NPC Sera Daily More Hub]]>><<pass 3>><</link>><br>
<<mpclockworkicon>><<link [[翻看午后校时页 (0:03)|MP NPC Sera Daily More2 Hub]]>><<pass 3>><</link>><br>
<<mpbellicon>><<link [[查看出诊与跨年钟 (0:03)|MP NPC Sera Date More Hub]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>

:: MP NPC Sera Daily More Hub [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "town">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<if !$mpNpcs>><<set $mpNpcs to {}>><</if>>
<<if !$mpNpcs.sera>><<set $mpNpcs.sera to { love: 0, trust: 0, lust: 0, dom: 0, corruption: 0, stage: 0, hasMet: 1, cadence: 25, axis: 25 }>><</if>>
<<set _sera to $mpNpcs.sera>>
<<if !$daily>><<set $daily to {}>><</if>>
柜台绒布上摆着三件街坊送来的急件。面包房姑娘送来的玻璃煮蛋沙漏<<if $daily.mpNpcDailySera10>>已经烘散白沙并重校了三分钟刻度<<else>>受潮结成硬块，倒过来一粒沙也不落<</if>>；学园教师抱来的课堂挂钟<<if $daily.mpNpcDailySera11>>已经拨正分针轴心重新走字<<else>>被扫帚捅歪了轴心，整间教室都不知何时下课<</if>>；老船工的铜壳雾钟<<if $daily.mpNpcDailySera12>>已经磨净内壁薄锈恢复清响<<else>>内壁生锈，敲下去像堵了一团棉花<</if>>。<<if _sera.hasMet>>塞拉<<else>>修表师<</if>>把镊子排齐等你搭手。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回总簿 (0:02)|MP NPC Sera More2 Hub]]>><<pass 2>><</link>><br>
<<mprepairicon>><<link [[烘散沙漏白沙 (0:05)|MP NPC Sera Daily 10]]>><<pass 5>><</link>><br>
<<mpclockworkicon>><<link [[校准学园旧挂钟 (0:05)|MP NPC Sera Daily 11]]>><<pass 5>><</link>><br>
<<mpbellicon>><<link [[打磨铜雾钟内壁锈 (0:05)|MP NPC Sera Daily 12]]>><<pass 5>><</link>>

:: MP NPC Sera Daily More2 Hub [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "town">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<if !$mpNpcs>><<set $mpNpcs to {}>><</if>>
<<if !$mpNpcs.sera>><<set $mpNpcs.sera to { love: 0, trust: 0, lust: 0, dom: 0, corruption: 0, stage: 0, hasMet: 1, cadence: 25, axis: 25 }>><</if>>
<<set _sera to $mpNpcs.sera>>
<<if !$daily>><<set $daily to {}>><</if>>
午后内务页记着下午三点与打烊前的两桩事。行会老技师提着标准表匣来抽检店里的航海钟与旅行钟，<<if $daily.mpNpcDailySera13>>今日的三只抽检表已经全数过关签字<<else>>她要把柜台清空，等老技师逐只核对日差<</if>>；打烊前最后十分钟，<<if $daily.mpNpcDailySera14>>她已经摘下腕表靠在门框边静坐了整整十分钟<<else>>她打算把腕表锁进抽屉，试试不看表能不能数准六百秒<</if>>。<<if _sera.hasMet>>塞拉<<else>>修表师<</if>>抬眼看你先陪她做哪桩。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[回校时总簿 (0:02)|MP NPC Sera More2 Hub]]>><<pass 2>><</link>><br>
<<mpcalculateicon>><<link [[陪她应付抽检 (0:05)|MP NPC Sera Daily 13]]>><<pass 5>><</link>><br>
<<mpwatchicon>><<link [[打烊前陪她静坐会 (0:05)|MP NPC Sera Daily 14]]>><<pass 5>><</link>>

:: MP NPC Sera Date More Hub [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "town">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<if !$mpNpcs>><<set $mpNpcs to {}>><</if>>
<<if !$mpNpcs.sera>><<set $mpNpcs.sera to { love: 0, trust: 0, lust: 0, dom: 0, corruption: 0, stage: 0, hasMet: 1, cadence: 25, axis: 25 }>><</if>>
<<set _sera to $mpNpcs.sera>>
<<if !$daily>><<set $daily to {}>><</if>>
<<set _seraYearNow to (Time.date.year or 0)>>
出诊专页记着两趟远门与腊月跨年钟声。城西车站的站台大钟<<if $daily.mpNpcDateSera5>>今日已经加固过横梁摆锤<<else>>每逢快车进站就慢三秒，得赶在四点快车到站前去听振频<</if>>；城北山坡的旧铁皮水塔<<if $daily.mpNpcDateSera6>>今夜已经在雨里听过全镇回音<<else>>在晚八点大雨里能听见全镇钟声撞出的共鸣<</if>>。至于高街钟楼的跨年十二响，<<if (_sera.festivalYear or 0) is _seraYearNow>>今年的跨年钟声已经落定<<elseif Time.season is "winter">>眼下正是校钟搓红绳的时节<<else>>要等腊月岁末才会启封<</if>>。

<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回总目 (0:02)|MP NPC Sera More2 Hub]]>><<pass 2>><</link>><br>
<<walkicon>><<link [[先去城西车站 (0:05)|MP NPC Sera Date 5]]>><<pass 5>><</link>><br>
<<investigateicon>><<link [[前往北坡旧水塔 (0:05)|MP NPC Sera Date 6]]>><<pass 5>><</link>><br>
<<if _sera.hasMet and Time.season is "winter" and ((_sera.festivalYear or 0) isnot _seraYearNow)>><<mplampicon>><<link [[翻看跨年钟声专页 (0:05)|MP NPC Sera Festival Prep]]>><<pass 5>><</link>><<else>><span class="disabled">跨年钟声未启（需腊月且今年未过）</span><</if>>
:: MP NPC Sera Daily 10 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "town">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<if !$mpNpcs>><<set $mpNpcs to {}>><</if>>
<<if !$mpNpcs.sera>><<set $mpNpcs.sera to { love: 0, trust: 0, lust: 0, dom: 0, corruption: 0, stage: 0, hasMet: 1, cadence: 25, axis: 25 }>><</if>>
<<set _sera to $mpNpcs.sera>>
<<if !$daily>><<set $daily to {}>><</if>>
十点零六分，面包房学徒送来的玻璃煮蛋钟搁在绒布上，里面的白沙受潮又受炉火烘烤，结成了一整块。<<if _sera.hasMet>>塞拉<<else>>修表师<</if>>拧开铜后盖，把沙粒倒进小铜盘，说三分钟的蛋与四分半的蛋差九十秒，得把白沙在酒精灯上微火烘散，再对照秒表一勺勺重校流量。<<if $daily.mpNpcDailySera10>>煮蛋沙漏已经重新封盖，白沙落尽恰好停在第一百八十秒。<<else>>她点亮酒精灯等你搭手。<</if>>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[回前台急件 (0:02)|MP NPC Sera Daily More Hub]]>><<pass 2>><</link>><br>
<<mprepairicon>><<link [[用小勺翻烘沙 (0:06)|MP NPC Sera Daily 10 After]]>><<pass 6>><<set $daily.mpNpcDailyActSera10 to 1>><<if ($housekeeping or 0) gte 200 or (_sera.cadence or 25) gte 45>><<set $daily.mpNpcDailyOkSera10 to 1>><<else>><<set $daily.mpNpcDailyOkSera10 to 0>><</if>><</link>><br>
<<mpcalculateicon>><<link [[对照秒表测量沙流 (0:05)|MP NPC Sera Daily 10 After]]>><<pass 5>><<set $daily.mpNpcDailyActSera10 to 2>><<if ($maths or 0) gte 200 or (_sera.cadence or 25) gte 45>><<set $daily.mpNpcDailyOkSera10 to 1>><<else>><<set $daily.mpNpcDailyOkSera10 to 0>><</if>><</link>>

:: MP NPC Sera Daily 11 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "town">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<if !$mpNpcs>><<set $mpNpcs to {}>><</if>>
<<if !$mpNpcs.sera>><<set $mpNpcs.sera to { love: 0, trust: 0, lust: 0, dom: 0, corruption: 0, stage: 0, hasMet: 1, cadence: 25, axis: 25 }>><</if>>
<<set _sera to $mpNpcs.sera>>
<<if !$daily>><<set $daily to {}>><</if>>
下午一点四十分，学园年轻教师抱来一只玻璃裂了细纹的课堂挂钟，两根指针无力地垂在六点位置，门口还探头探脑跟着两个犯错的学生。<<if _sera.hasMet>>塞拉<<else>>修表师<</if>>拨了拨分针，说轴心只歪了半格，用铜镊垫平就能重新咬合，不必让孩子们等上三周。<<if $daily.mpNpcDailySera11>>课堂挂钟已经恢复清脆的滴答声，学生们规规矩矩道了谢。<<else>>她让你先稳住挂钟木框或安抚门口的孩子。<</if>>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[回前台急件 (0:02)|MP NPC Sera Daily More Hub]]>><<pass 2>><</link>><br>
<<socialiseicon>><<link [[教小孩子认钟 (0:08)|MP NPC Sera Daily 11 After]]>><<pass 8>><<set $daily.mpNpcDailyActSera11 to 1>><<if ($maths or 0) gte 200 or (_sera.love or 0) gte 10>><<set $daily.mpNpcDailyOkSera11 to 1>><<else>><<set $daily.mpNpcDailyOkSera11 to 0>><</if>><</link>><br>
<<mprepairicon>><<link [[按稳木框替她正轴 (0:05)|MP NPC Sera Daily 11 After]]>><<pass 5>><<set $daily.mpNpcDailyActSera11 to 2>><<if ($athletics or 0) gte 200 or ($housekeeping or 0) gte 200>><<set $daily.mpNpcDailyOkSera11 to 1>><<else>><<set $daily.mpNpcDailyOkSera11 to 0>><</if>><</link>>

:: MP NPC Sera Daily 12 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "town">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<if !$mpNpcs>><<set $mpNpcs to {}>><</if>>
<<if !$mpNpcs.sera>><<set $mpNpcs.sera to { love: 0, trust: 0, lust: 0, dom: 0, corruption: 0, stage: 0, hasMet: 1, cadence: 25, axis: 25 }>><</if>>
<<set _sera to $mpNpcs.sera>>
<<if !$daily>><<set $daily to {}>><</if>>
海雾漫街的午后，老船工把一只结着白盐霜的铜壳雾钟放在柜台上，苦着脸说这两天敲下去只剩闷响。<<if _sera.hasMet>>塞拉<<else>>修表师<</if>>用指节轻叩钟壁听音，点出是海风盐气在钟壳内壁与锤头结了一层薄锈，吃掉了余音。<<if $daily.mpNpcDailySera12>>铜雾钟内壁的盐锈已经打磨干净，轻轻一叩便荡开悠长的铜音。<<else>>她滴上两滴煤油拧开死扣螺丝，递给你一块细油石。<</if>>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[回前台急件 (0:02)|MP NPC Sera Daily More Hub]]>><<pass 2>><</link>><br>
<<mpclockworkicon>><<link [[侧耳听音辨锈 (0:07)|MP NPC Sera Daily 12 After]]>><<pass 7>><<set $daily.mpNpcDailyActSera12 to 1>><<if (_sera.cadence or 25) gte 40 or ($science or 0) gte 200>><<set $daily.mpNpcDailyOkSera12 to 1>><<else>><<set $daily.mpNpcDailyOkSera12 to 0>><</if>><</link>><br>
<<mprepairicon>><<link [[拿细油石打磨锤头 (0:06)|MP NPC Sera Daily 12 After]]>><<pass 6>><<set $daily.mpNpcDailyActSera12 to 2>><<if ($housekeeping or 0) gte 200 or ($athletics or 0) gte 220>><<set $daily.mpNpcDailyOkSera12 to 1>><<else>><<set $daily.mpNpcDailyOkSera12 to 0>><</if>><</link>>

:: MP NPC Sera Daily 13 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "town">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<if !$mpNpcs>><<set $mpNpcs to {}>><</if>>
<<if !$mpNpcs.sera>><<set $mpNpcs.sera to { love: 0, trust: 0, lust: 0, dom: 0, corruption: 0, stage: 0, hasMet: 1, cadence: 25, axis: 25 }>><</if>>
<<set _sera to $mpNpcs.sera>>
<<if !$daily>><<set $daily to {}>><</if>>
下午三点差两分，行会老技师提着黑木标准表匣准时进门，抽检店里的航海钟与墙角那只最小的旅行钟。<<if _sera.hasMet>>塞拉<<else>>修表师<</if>>把柜台杂物全数收起，神色平静，唯有捏着黄铜镊子的指尖微紧。<<if $daily.mpNpcDailySera13>>老技师在检定签上写下「零误差」并盖了红印，她的肩线终于松了下来。<<else>>对表的五分钟里整间铺子只有两套擒纵轮咬合的轻响。<</if>>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[回午后内务 (0:02)|MP NPC Sera Daily More2 Hub]]>><<pass 2>><</link>><br>
<<mpcalculateicon>><<link [[陪她等候检定 (0:09)|MP NPC Sera Daily 13 After]]>><<pass 9>><<set $daily.mpNpcDailyActSera13 to 1>><<if ($science or 0) gte 200 or (_sera.trust or 0) gte 10>><<set $daily.mpNpcDailyOkSera13 to 1>><<else>><<set $daily.mpNpcDailyOkSera13 to 0>><</if>><</link>><br>
<<mprepairicon>><<link [[稳稳递上校音铜镊 (0:05)|MP NPC Sera Daily 13 After]]>><<pass 5>><<set $daily.mpNpcDailyActSera13 to 2>><<if ($maths or 0) gte 200 or (_sera.cadence or 25) gte 45>><<set $daily.mpNpcDailyOkSera13 to 1>><<else>><<set $daily.mpNpcDailyOkSera13 to 0>><</if>><</link>>

:: MP NPC Sera Daily 14 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "town">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<if !$mpNpcs>><<set $mpNpcs to {}>><</if>>
<<if !$mpNpcs.sera>><<set $mpNpcs.sera to { love: 0, trust: 0, lust: 0, dom: 0, corruption: 0, stage: 0, hasMet: 1, cadence: 25, axis: 25 }>><</if>>
<<set _sera to $mpNpcs.sera>>
<<if !$daily>><<set $daily to {}>><</if>>
打烊前十分钟，<<if _sera.hasMet>>塞拉<<else>>修表师<</if>>破天荒地摘下从不离身的腕表，锁进柜台抽屉。她搬了张木凳坐到铺门边，背靠门框看着高街路灯一盏盏亮起，说想试试不看表盘只靠呼吸能不能数准这六百秒，让你替她看着时间。<<if $daily.mpNpcDailySera14>>十分钟到点时她恰好睁开眼，误差不到两秒，嘴角弯起一抹极浅的笑意。<<else>>晚风吹起她耳畔的碎发，她的呼吸渐渐放慢。<</if>>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[回午后内务 (0:02)|MP NPC Sera Daily More2 Hub]]>><<pass 2>><</link>><br>
<<mpdrinkicon>><<link [[陪她坐十分钟 (0:10)|MP NPC Sera Daily 14 After]]>><<pass 10>><<set $daily.mpNpcDailyActSera14 to 1>><<if ($willpower or 0) gte 200 or (_sera.cadence or 25) gte 35>><<set $daily.mpNpcDailyOkSera14 to 1>><<else>><<set $daily.mpNpcDailyOkSera14 to 0>><</if>><</link>><br>
<<mpwatchicon>><<link [[到点轻敲门框报时 (0:05)|MP NPC Sera Daily 14 After]]>><<pass 5>><<set $daily.mpNpcDailyActSera14 to 2>><<if ($maths or 0) gte 200 or (_sera.cadence or 25) gte 40>><<set $daily.mpNpcDailyOkSera14 to 1>><<else>><<set $daily.mpNpcDailyOkSera14 to 0>><</if>><</link>>

:: MP NPC Sera Date 5 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "town">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<if !$mpNpcs>><<set $mpNpcs to {}>><</if>>
<<if !$mpNpcs.sera>><<set $mpNpcs.sera to { love: 0, trust: 0, lust: 0, dom: 0, corruption: 0, stage: 0, hasMet: 1, cadence: 25, axis: 25 }>><</if>>
<<set _sera to $mpNpcs.sera>>
<<if !$daily>><<set $daily to {}>><</if>>
城西车站的站长在下午四点差一刻赶来，说站台大钟每逢快车进站就慢三秒，车一走又自己追回来。<<if _sera.hasMet>>塞拉<<else>>修表师<</if>>取上软铅丝与水平玻璃管，锁好铺门同你赶往车站，说病根不在机芯，而在快车进站时震斜了站台铁棚横梁。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[回出诊目录 (0:02)|MP NPC Sera Date More Hub]]>><<pass 2>><</link>><br>
<<mphearticon>><<link [[随她走近站台 (0:08)|MP NPC Sera Date 5 Choice]]>><<pass 8>><</link>><br>
<<mpwatchicon>><<link [[先核对快车时刻表 (0:05)|MP NPC Sera Date 5 Choice]]>><<pass 5>><<stress -1>><</link>>

:: MP NPC Sera Date 5 Choice [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "town">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<if !$mpNpcs>><<set $mpNpcs to {}>><</if>>
<<if !$mpNpcs.sera>><<set $mpNpcs.sera to { love: 0, trust: 0, lust: 0, dom: 0, corruption: 0, stage: 0, hasMet: 1, cadence: 25, axis: 25 }>><</if>>
<<set _sera to $mpNpcs.sera>>
<<if !$daily>><<set $daily to {}>><</if>>
候车棚下挤满等车的旅客，距离四点整的蒸汽快车进站只剩八分钟。<<if _sera.hasMet>>塞拉<<else>>修表师<</if>>戴好棉线手套仰望铁棚横梁上的大钟，说上检修梯缠铅丝配重、去月台尽头听汽笛报时、或在候车室盯挂钟对比，都能帮她锁定那三秒的震幅。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[退回入口 (0:02)|MP NPC Sera Date 5]]>><<pass 2>><</link>><br>
<<mprepairicon>><<link [[扶梯登棚校摆 (0:20)|MP NPC Sera Date 5 After]]>><<pass 20>><<set $daily.mpNpcDateSera5Outcome to (($athletics or 0) gte 200 or (_sera.trust or 0) gte 10 ? 3 : 2)>><<tiredness 2>><</link>><br>
<<mpcalculateicon>><<link [[去月台听笛对表 (0:16)|MP NPC Sera Date 5 After]]>><<pass 16>><<set $daily.mpNpcDateSera5Outcome to 2>><<tiredness 1>><</link>><br>
<<mpdrinkicon>><<link [[在候车室买茶记时 (0:12)|MP NPC Sera Date 5 After]]>><<pass 12>><<set $daily.mpNpcDateSera5Outcome to 1>><<tiredness 1>><</link>>

:: MP NPC Sera Date 5 After [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "town">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<if !$mpNpcs>><<set $mpNpcs to {}>><</if>>
<<if !$mpNpcs.sera>><<set $mpNpcs.sera to { love: 0, trust: 0, lust: 0, dom: 0, corruption: 0, stage: 0, hasMet: 1, cadence: 25, axis: 25 }>><</if>>
<<set _sera to $mpNpcs.sera>>
<<if !$daily>><<set $daily to {}>><</if>>
<<set _first to !$daily.mpNpcDateSera5>>
<<set _out to ($daily.mpNpcDateSera5Outcome or 2)>>
<<set $daily.mpNpcDateSera5 to 1>>
蒸汽快车裹着白雾轰隆进站时，整座铁棚果然微微下沉。<<if _sera.hasMet>>塞拉<<else>>修表师<</if>>在震动峰值用软铅丝箍紧摆锤副重，分针稳稳跨过四点整，一秒未慢。<<if _out gte 2>>她从检修梯上下来时难得主动扶了扶你的肩膀，说两个人的节拍比单人校表快了一倍。<<if _first>><<set _sera.love to Math.min(100, (_sera.love or 0) + 3)>><<set _sera.trust to Math.min(100, (_sera.trust or 0) + 3)>><</if>><<stress -5>><<else>>你们在候车室核完三组数据，她认真记进随身小册，与你并肩踏上回程。<<if _first>><<set _sera.love to Math.min(100, (_sera.love or 0) + 2)>><<set _sera.trust to Math.min(100, (_sera.trust or 0) + 2)>><</if>><<stress -4>><</if>>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[回出诊目录 (0:02)|MP NPC Sera Date More Hub]]>><<pass 2>><</link>><br>
<<walkicon>><<link [[沿铁路边回铺子 (0:04)|MP NPC Sera More2 Hub]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>

:: MP NPC Sera Date 6 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "town">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<if !$mpNpcs>><<set $mpNpcs to {}>><</if>>
<<if !$mpNpcs.sera>><<set $mpNpcs.sera to { love: 0, trust: 0, lust: 0, dom: 0, corruption: 0, stage: 0, hasMet: 1, cadence: 25, axis: 25 }>><</if>>
<<set _sera to $mpNpcs.sera>>
<<if !$daily>><<set $daily to {}>><</if>>
晚八点大雨如注，<<if _sera.hasMet>>塞拉<<else>>修表师<</if>>披上厚呢短袄站在铺门口听雨。她说城北高坡上的旧铁皮水塔四面无遮，大雨敲击铁皮时，全镇各处的晚钟回音会在水塔顶撞出奇妙的共鸣，问你愿不愿意冒雨去听一回活过来的钟声。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[回出诊目录 (0:02)|MP NPC Sera Date More Hub]]>><<pass 2>><</link>><br>
<<walkicon>><<link [[撑伞去北水塔 (0:12)|MP NPC Sera Date 6 Choice]]>><<pass 12>><</link>><br>
<<mpwatchicon>><<link [[先在檐下听雨对表 (0:05)|MP NPC Sera Date 6 Choice]]>><<pass 5>><<stress -1>><</link>>

:: MP NPC Sera Date 6 Choice [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "town">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<if !$mpNpcs>><<set $mpNpcs to {}>><</if>>
<<if !$mpNpcs.sera>><<set $mpNpcs.sera to { love: 0, trust: 0, lust: 0, dom: 0, corruption: 0, stage: 0, hasMet: 1, cadence: 25, axis: 25 }>><</if>>
<<set _sera to $mpNpcs.sera>>
<<if !$daily>><<set $daily to {}>><</if>>
暗红色的旧铁皮水塔耸立在雨幕里，雨水顺着铆钉串成水帘。<<if _sera.hasMet>>塞拉<<else>>修表师<</if>>把手电照向塔身外侧的检修梯、塔基石阶与坡下干爽的石桥洞：离九点整全镇报时还有五分钟，三个位置能听见三种截然不同的回音。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[退回坡下 (0:02)|MP NPC Sera Date 6]]>><<pass 2>><</link>><br>
<<mpclockworkicon>><<link [[爬检修梯登顶 (0:20)|MP NPC Sera Date 6 After]]>><<pass 20>><<set $daily.mpNpcDateSera6Outcome to (($athletics or 0) gte 200 or (_sera.trust or 0) gte 12 ? 3 : 2)>><<tiredness 2>><</link>><br>
<<mpdrinkicon>><<link [[留在塔基听共鸣 (0:16)|MP NPC Sera Date 6 After]]>><<pass 16>><<set $daily.mpNpcDateSera6Outcome to 2>><<tiredness 1>><</link>><br>
<<walkicon>><<link [[退到桥洞听雨中钟 (0:12)|MP NPC Sera Date 6 After]]>><<pass 12>><<set $daily.mpNpcDateSera6Outcome to 1>><</link>>

:: MP NPC Sera Date 6 After [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "town">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<if !$mpNpcs>><<set $mpNpcs to {}>><</if>>
<<if !$mpNpcs.sera>><<set $mpNpcs.sera to { love: 0, trust: 0, lust: 0, dom: 0, corruption: 0, stage: 0, hasMet: 1, cadence: 25, axis: 25 }>><</if>>
<<set _sera to $mpNpcs.sera>>
<<if !$daily>><<set $daily to {}>><</if>>
<<set _first to !$daily.mpNpcDateSera6>>
<<set _out to ($daily.mpNpcDateSera6Outcome or 2)>>
<<set $daily.mpNpcDateSera6 to 1>>
九点整的钟声穿过雨幕接连传来：先是高街主钟，接着是神殿与旧港雾钟，三道声浪在铁皮水塔腹腔里叠成浑厚悠长的嗡鸣。<<if _sera.hasMet>>塞拉<<else>>修表师<</if>>把耳朵贴在冰凉的铁壁上，眼睛亮得惊人。<<if _out gte 2>>她握住你微凉的手指，按着嗡鸣的余振一下下数完九拍，说全镇的时间在这一刻真正合拢了。<<if _first>><<set _sera.love to Math.min(100, (_sera.love or 0) + 3)>><<set _sera.trust to Math.min(100, (_sera.trust or 0) + 3)>><</if>><<stress -6>><<else>>你们在桥洞下并肩听完雨中回音，她把怀表收进内袋，步伐轻快地同你下山。<<if _first>><<set _sera.love to Math.min(100, (_sera.love or 0) + 2)>><<set _sera.trust to Math.min(100, (_sera.trust or 0) + 2)>><</if>><<stress -4>><</if>>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[回出诊目录 (0:02)|MP NPC Sera Date More Hub]]>><<pass 2>><</link>><br>
<<walkicon>><<link [[共撑一伞回高街 (0:04)|MP NPC Sera More2 Hub]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>

:: MP NPC Sera Festival Prep [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "town">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<if !$mpNpcs>><<set $mpNpcs to {}>><</if>>
<<if !$mpNpcs.sera>><<set $mpNpcs.sera to { love: 0, trust: 0, lust: 0, dom: 0, corruption: 0, stage: 0, hasMet: 1, cadence: 25, axis: 25 }>><</if>>
<<set _sera to $mpNpcs.sera>>
<<if _sera.axis is undefined>><<set _sera.axis to (_sera.cadence or 25)>><</if>>
腊月最后几天，钟表铺比平日早开了半个时辰。<<if _sera.hasMet>>塞拉<<else>>修表师<</if>>先低头看表，才把一只蒙着绒布的木匣推到柜台正中，说除夕夜高街钟楼的十二下跨年钟得有人替它数着拍子：校音锤、铜钟外壳与钟绳末端的三股红绳都得提前备齐。

<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回目录 (0:02)|MP NPC Sera Date More Hub]]>><<pass 2>><</link>><br>
<<mprepairicon>><<link [[去备节前物料 (0:10)|MP NPC Sera Festival]]>><<pass 10>><<set $mpNpcs.sera.festivalPrep to "ready">><<set $mpNpcs.sera.festivalPrepYear to (Time.date.year or 0)>><<stress -2>><</link>>
:: MP NPC Sera Festival [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "town">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<if !$mpNpcs>><<set $mpNpcs to {}>><</if>>
<<if !$mpNpcs.sera>><<set $mpNpcs.sera to { love: 0, trust: 0, lust: 0, dom: 0, corruption: 0, stage: 0, hasMet: 1, cadence: 25, axis: 25 }>><</if>>
<<set _sera to $mpNpcs.sera>>
<<if !$daily>><<set $daily to {}>><</if>>
除夕前夜，高街路灯一盏盏亮到钟楼脚下。<<if _sera.hasMet>>塞拉<<else>>修表师<</if>>站在铺门口，围巾上落着细雪，离午夜十二响还有一刻钟。她把系着红绳的钟索交到你手边，轻声叮嘱说钟不认人只认拍子，按你稳得住的节拍拉绳就行。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[退回目录 (0:02)|MP NPC Sera Date More Hub]]>><<pass 2>><</link>><br>
<<mpbellicon>><<link [[准点敲十二下 (0:20)|MP NPC Sera Festival Resolve]]>><<pass 20>><<set $daily.mpSeraFestivalOutcome to (((_sera.cadence or 25) gte 50 or _sera.festivalPrep is "ready" or ((_sera.festivalPrepYear or 0) is (Time.date.year or 0))) ? 3 : 2)>><<tiredness 2>><</link>><br>
<<mpclockworkicon>><<link [[登塔调擒纵耗力 (0:25)|MP NPC Sera Festival Resolve]]>><<pass 25>><<set $daily.mpSeraFestivalOutcome to (((($athletics or 0) gte 250 or ($science or 0) gte 250) and (_sera.cadence or 0) gte 40) ? 3 : 2)>><<tiredness 3>><</link>><br>
<<mpwatchicon>><<link [[守在钟架下掐秒表 (0:18)|MP NPC Sera Festival Resolve]]>><<pass 18>><<set $daily.mpSeraFestivalOutcome to ((($willpower or 0) gte 220 or (_sera.axis or 25) gte 40) ? 2 : 1)>><<tiredness 2>><</link>>

:: MP NPC Sera Festival Resolve [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "town">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<if !$mpNpcs>><<set $mpNpcs to {}>><</if>>
<<if !$mpNpcs.sera>><<set $mpNpcs.sera to { love: 0, trust: 0, lust: 0, dom: 0, corruption: 0, stage: 0, hasMet: 1, cadence: 25, axis: 25 }>><</if>>
<<set _sera to $mpNpcs.sera>>
<<if !$daily>><<set $daily to {}>><</if>>
<<set _first to ((_sera.festivalYear or 0) isnot (Time.date.year or 0))>>
<<set _out to ($daily.mpSeraFestivalOutcome or 2)>>
<<set _sera.festivalResult to _out>>
钟楼的十二下洪钟在夜空落定，余音顺着高街石板铺向全城。<<if _sera.hasMet>>塞拉<<else>>修表师<</if>>先低头核了一眼基准怀表，才抬起眼看你。<<if _out is 3>>十二响分秒不差，行会照例送来新岁校钟赏钱，她把那截红绳解下来系在你腕间。<<if _first>><<set _sera.axis to Math.min(100, (_sera.axis or 25) + 6)>><<set _sera.cadence to Math.min(100, (_sera.cadence or 25) + 8)>><<set _sera.love to Math.min(100, (_sera.love or 0) + 2)>><<money 900>><<stress -6>><</if>><<elseif _out is 2>>末两声略快了半拍，但音色清亮，她满意地合上表盖，将行会津贴分了一半给你。<<if _first>><<set _sera.axis to Math.min(100, (_sera.axis or 25) + 3)>><<set _sera.cadence to Math.min(100, (_sera.cadence or 25) + 4)>><<money 400>><<stress -4>><</if>><<else>>寒风冻僵了手指，钟声乱了节拍，没能领到半分校钟贴补。<<if _first>><<set _sera.axis to Math.max(0, (_sera.axis or 25) - 3)>><<stress 4>><<tiredness 2>><</if>><</if>><<set _sera.festivalYear to (Time.date.year or 0)>>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[回出诊目录 (0:02)|MP NPC Sera Date More Hub]]>><<pass 2>><</link>><br>
<<if _out is 1>><<walkicon>><<link [[查看错过夜钟 (0:04)|MP NPC Sera Festival Missed]]>><<pass 4>><</link>><<else>><<mpdrinkicon>><<link [[随她回铺看余波 (0:04)|MP NPC Sera Festival After]]>><<pass 4>><</link>><</if>>

:: MP NPC Sera Festival After [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "town">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<if !$mpNpcs>><<set $mpNpcs to {}>><</if>>
<<if !$mpNpcs.sera>><<set $mpNpcs.sera to { love: 0, trust: 0, lust: 0, dom: 0, corruption: 0, stage: 0, hasMet: 1, cadence: 25, axis: 25 }>><</if>>
<<set _sera to $mpNpcs.sera>>
<<set _res to (_sera.festivalResult or 2)>>
新年后的第一个午后，高街积雪化了一半。<<if _sera.hasMet>>塞拉<<else>>修表师<</if>>把盘好的钟绳搁在柜台角，末端的红绳结还留着除夕夜的形状。<<if _res is 3>>她在校时簿扉页记下「零秒误差」，并泡了一壶佛手柑红茶与你慢慢分饮。<<elseif _res is 2>>她把半拍误差折算进春天的摆锤配重表，说下回再合拉一次就能严丝合缝。<<else>>她带着你在小钟架上重新练了一遍十二响的呼吸节拍，直到你手心不再发紧。<</if>>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[回出诊目录 (0:02)|MP NPC Sera Date More Hub]]>><<pass 2>><</link>><br>
<<mpbellicon>><<link [[抬头望一眼钟楼 (0:04)|MP NPC Sera More2 Hub]]>><<pass 4>><<stress -2>><</link>>

