<<if !$mpNpcs>><<set $mpNpcs to {}>><</if>>
<<if !$mpNpcs.sera>><<set $mpNpcs.sera to { love: 0, trust: 0, lust: 0, dom: 0, corruption: 0, stage: 0, hasMet: 1, cadence: 25, axis: 25, fatherLog: 0 }>><</if>>
<<set _sera to $mpNpcs.sera>>
<<if !$daily>><<set $daily to {}>><</if>>
<<set _act to ($daily.mpNpcDailyActSera13 or 1)>>
<<set _ok to ($daily.mpNpcDailyOkSera13 or 0)>>
三点差两分，行会老技师提着黑木表匣进门，<<if _sera.hasMet>>塞拉<<else>>修表师<</if>>把柜台上的杂物一件件收进抽屉。<<if _act is 1 and _ok>>你站在她侧后方替她递册子、报日差，三只抽检表全数过关，老技师在检定签上盖了红印。<<elseif _act is 1>>你报错了一只旅行钟的日差，老技师的笔停了一停，塞拉接过册子重新核了一遍才签字。<<elseif _ok>>你稳稳把校音铜镊递到她手边，她指尖不再发紧，拆盖、对表、合盖一气呵成，零误差收场。<<else>>镊子递得慢了半拍，她伸手接空，铜镊磕在柜面上，检定只好延到明天重来。<</if>>
<<if !$daily.mpNpcDailySera13>>
<<set $daily.mpNpcDailySera13 to 1>>
<<set _sera.trust to Math.min(100, (_sera.trust or 0) + 1)>>
<<if _ok>><<set _sera.cadence to Math.min(100, (_sera.cadence or 25) + 1)>><<set _sera.axis to (_sera.cadence or 25)>><<set _sera.love to Math.min(100, (_sera.love or 0) + 1)>><<stress -3>><<else>><<stress -1>><<tiredness 1>><</if>>
<</if>>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[回午后页 (0:02)|MP NPC Sera Daily More2 Hub]]>><<pass 2>><</link>><br>
<<walkicon>><<link [[去下一件事 (0:03)|MP NPC Sera Daily More2 Hub]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>

:: MP NPC Sera Daily 14 After [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "town">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<if !$mpNpcs>><<set $mpNpcs to {}>><</if>>
<<if !$mpNpcs.sera>><<set $mpNpcs.sera to { love: 0, trust: 0, lust: 0, dom: 0, corruption: 0, stage: 0, hasMet: 1, cadence: 25, axis: 25, fatherLog: 0 }>><</if>>
<<set _sera to $mpNpcs.sera>>
<<if !$daily>><<set $daily to {}>><</if>>
<<set _act to ($daily.mpNpcDailyActSera14 or 1)>>
<<set _ok to ($daily.mpNpcDailyOkSera14 or 0)>>
打烊前十分钟，<<if _sera.hasMet>>塞拉<<else>>修表师<</if>>把腕表锁进抽屉，背靠门框坐到铺门边，说这六百秒只靠呼吸来数。<<if _act is 1 and _ok>>你陪她并肩坐着，跟着她的呼吸慢慢数拍，十分钟到点她睁眼，误差不到两秒，嘴角弯了一下。<<elseif _act is 1>>你坐不住，几次想去看表，她被你带乱了呼吸，十分钟数成了九分半，只好笑着摇头。<<elseif _ok>>到点你轻敲三下门框，她睁眼时正卡在第六百秒，说你的拍子比怀表还稳。<<else>>你敲早了半分钟，她睁开眼愣了一下，把腕表从抽屉里取出来重新对了一遍。<</if>>
<<if !$daily.mpNpcDailySera14>>
<<set $daily.mpNpcDailySera14 to 1>>
<<set _sera.trust to Math.min(100, (_sera.trust or 0) + 1)>>
<<if _ok>><<set _sera.cadence to Math.min(100, (_sera.cadence or 25) + 1)>><<set _sera.axis to (_sera.cadence or 25)>><<set _sera.love to Math.min(100, (_sera.love or 0) + 1)>><<stress -3>><<else>><<stress -1>><<tiredness 1>><</if>>
<</if>>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[回午后页 (0:02)|MP NPC Sera Daily More2 Hub]]>><<pass 2>><</link>><br>
<<walkicon>><<link [[去下一件事 (0:03)|MP NPC Sera Daily More2 Hub]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
